  message: "Shipped. Detect extension functions in kotlin.py via _extract_kotlin_receiver_type (walks function_declaration children for user_type-before-identifier pattern). Sets Symbol.is_exported=True and stores receiver type in meta.extension_receiver. 3 tests. Full receiver-typed dispatch resolution (emit edges from receiver.extMethod() to the extension function) remains a separate follow-up."  # f921
